              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "T2: the reason the most recent recording START failed, if any. `null`\nwhen the last start succeeded or none has been attempted - lets an agent\npolling this endpoint after a failed start learn WHY instead of seeing a\nbare \"idle\". Cleared on the next successful start."
          },
          "state": {
            "type": "string"
          }
